- **Router0 running config**: completely empty — no `router rip` block whatsoever.
- **Router0 kernel table**: only three directly-connected routes (192.168.1.0/24, 192.168.2.0/24, 10.0.0.0/8) — no knowledge of 192.168.3.0/24 (Office) or 192.168.4.0/24 (Principle).
